SUMMARY:QHHT : Past Life Regression Introduction
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAn Introduction to QHHT: Exploring the Su
 bconscious\n\nCurious about Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique (QHHT)? Joi
 n me for a relaxed\, 45-minute introduction to this approach to guided hyp
 nosis\, pastlife regression\, and personal exploration.\n\nWe’ll talk ab
 out what a QHHT session involves\, how people prepare\, and the kinds of q
 uestions they may choose to bring. I’ll also explain what the experience
  can feel like and leave time for your questions.\n\nCome with curiosity a
 nd any questions you have. This is an informational gathering\; we won’t
  conduct individual QHHT sessions during the event.
