SUMMARY:QHHT session with Shaman Phil
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nExplore Your Inner Wisdom: A Personal QHH
 T Session\n\nJoin me for a private\, in-person session near Nebo\, NC\, ba
 sed on Dolores Cannon’s Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique (QHHT).\n\nTh
 is approximately three-hour session offers an opportunity to explore past-
 life experiences through guided hypnosis and connect with what this practi
 ce calls your Higher Self. Bring your curiosity\, questions\, and intentio
 ns as we explore insights that may support deeper self-understanding and p
 ersonal reflection.\n\nThis appointment is reserved for one person. Sessio
 ns take place in my home\, where we have friendly cats and a dog. Please l
 et me know beforehand if you have allergies or concerns about animals. For
  an additional fee\, I can also arrange to meet at your home or a mutually
  agreed-upon location.\n\nTo help you prepare\, I’ll email you a few sim
 ple activities and instructions to complete before our meeting. Please pro
 vide your email address when arranging your appointment.\n\nIf your plans 
 change\, please let me know as early as possible so I can offer the appoin
 tment to someone else.\n\nI look forward to welcoming you and sharing this
  experience.\n\nShaman Phil
